{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/344610-i-borrowed-the-mantle-benefits-from-kismet-rose-and-made-some-alterations","id":344610,"title":"I borrowed the Mantle benefits from Kismet Rose and made some alterations.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-19T06:16:48-08:00","id":344610,"title":"I borrowed the Mantle benefits from Kismet Rose and made some alterations.","content":"I would like your honest opinion. Is this too powerful? Would it be more balanced by making Mantle cost more XP and/or greater in-story justification? Do my alterations make sense thematically?<br /> <br /> Spring Court Mantle<br /> 1 dot: Gain a specialty in Crafts, Expression, Socialize, or Persuasion.<br /> 2 dots: Gain another specialty in one of the Skills mentioned above. Spending a willpower point when using one of those Skills grants a +5 bonus.<br /> 3 dots: Gain two dots to divide between Allies, Contacts, Fame, or Retainers<br /> 4 dots: Gain four dots to divide between Allies, Contacts, Fame, or Retainers. Creating Hedgespun Art and Hedgespun Raiment costs \u00bd of the normal XP, round down.<br /> 5 dots: Once per day, may add 8 Again on a non Contract Social roll by spending 1 glamour, OR get an Exceptional Success with 3 successes on a Contract to seduce, socialize, entertain or impress by spending 1 extra glamour (e.g. Vainglory, Fleeting Spring, Control The Elements, Artifice).<br /> <br /> Summer Court Mantle<br /> 1 dot: Gain a specialty in Athletics, Intimidation, Survival, or Streetwise<br /> 2 dots: Gain another specialty in one of the Skills mentioned above. Spending a willpower point when using Strength and those Skills grants a +5 bonus.<br /> 3 dots: Gain five dots to divide between Fighting Styles, Hedgespun Weapons or Hedgespun Raiment.<br /> 4 dots: gain another five dots to divide between Fighting Styles, Hedgespun Weapons or Hedgespun Raiment. Creating Hedgespun Weapons and Hedgespun Raiment costs \u00bd of the normal XP, round down.<br /> 5 dots: Gain 1 extra health level and 1/1 GMC Armor that stacks. May add the rote quality to a mundane Physical roll once per day by spending 1 glamour. Alternatively, once per day, get an Exceptional Success with 3 successes on the invocation of a Contract to enhance physical prowess or analyze/influence/traverse/create a duel or battlefield by spending 1 extra glamour (e.g. Stone, Eternal Summer, Punishing Summer Thorns And Brambles or Board).<br /> <br /> Autumn Court Mantle<br /> 1 dot: Gain a specialty in Investigation, Occult, Intimidation, or Stealth<br /> 2 dots: Gain another specialty in one of the Skills mentioned above. Spending a willpower point when using one of those Skills grants a +5 bonus.<br /> 3 dots: Gain two dots to divide between Prophet Circle, Archive, Token, or Mentor. You may cause the Cowed Tilt with Social Skills other than Intimidation.<br /> 4 dots: Gain four dots to divide between Prophet Circle, Archive, Token, or Mentor. Creating Hedgespun Machines and Hedgespun Automatons costs \u00bd of the normal XP, round down.<br /> 5 dots: once per session, you may gain the rote quality on a Resistance Roll made to fight the effects of a supernatural power by spending 1 glamour, regardless of its origin (Supernal, Gifts, Disciplines etc). Once per day, you may spend 1 extra glamour when invoking any Contract to find, investigate, study, understand, negotiate with, persuade or coerce the supernatural. This lets you get an Exceptional Successes with 3 successes (e.g. Spell Bound Autumn, Fleeting Autumn, Vainglory, Beg Barter And Steal).<br /> <br /> Winter Court Mantle<br /> 1 dot: Gain a specialty in Subterfuge, Stealth, Politics, or Larceny.<br /> 2 dots: Gain another specialty in one of the Skills mentioned above. Spending a willpower point when using one of those Skills grants a +5 bonus.<br /> 3 dots: Gain two dots to divide between New Identity, Hidden Life (maximum of 6 dots), Fae Mount, or Hollow.<br /> 4 dots: Gain four dots to divide between New Identity, Hidden Life (maximum of 6 dots), Fae Mount, or Hollow. Creating Hedgespun Machines and Hedgespun Raiment costs \u00bd of the normal XP, round down.<br /> 5 dots: once per day, spend 1 extra glamour when invoking any Contract to hide, lie or flee. This lets you get an Exceptional Success with 3 successes (e.g. Stone, Forge, Smoke, Mirror, several Goblin Contracts). Once per session, you may spend 1 glamour to gain the rote quality on all non Contract Stealth and Subterfuge rolls for one scene.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-20T15:14:28-08:00","id":346150,"title":"","content":"Certainly that's not something that should cost like regular Merits (2 per dot is the minimum IMO). It will take time to analyse everything, but first advice that comes to my mind: you could change +5 to rolls from spending Willpower to +4 because even one die can account for a lot and in my personal opinion +5 bonus is a lot.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}